      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Commonplace&lt;/strong&gt; is a shared digital commonplace book.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We collect and share book notes, key takeaways, mental models, and memorable passages — so insights from great books stay useful and discoverable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anyone can contribute. The goal is simple: make reading more cumulative and less ephemeral.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
